# 12. IPv6 Routing Tables

### Fallout Shelter

```text
S  2001:DB8:1:1::/64
   via 2001:DB8:1:3::1

S  2001:DB8:1:2::/64
   via 2001:DB8:1:3::1
```

The `S` means **Static**.

The directly connected networks are marked `C`:

```text
C  2001:DB8:1:3::/64
C  2001:DB8:1:4::/64
C  2001:DB8:1:5::/64
C  2001:DB8:1:6::/64
C  2001:DB8:1:7::/64
```

### Cafe

