# 13. Connectivity Verification

### Fallout Shelter → Cafe

From `FO-RT01`:

```cisco
ping 2001:DB8:1:1::1
```

Result:

```text
!!!!!
Success rate is 100 percent (5/5)
```

This confirms that the Fallout Shelter router can reach the Cafe's IPv6 VLAN interface.

### Cafe → Fallout Shelter

From `cafe01-RT01`:

```cisco
ping 2001:DB8:1:3::2
```

Result:

```text
!!!!!
Success rate is 100 percent (5/5)
```

This confirms IPv6 connectivity across the WAN to the Fallout Shelter router.

